{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@property","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" (","kind":"text"},{"text":"nonatomic","kind":"keyword"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"CLLocationDirection","preciseIdentifier":"c:@T@CLLocationDirection","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"direction","kind":"identifier"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The value ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"0"},{"text":" means that the top edge of the map view corresponds to true","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"north. The value ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"90"},{"text":" means the top of the map is pointing due east. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"value ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"180"},{"text":" means the top of the map points due south, and so on.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Changing the value of this property updates the map view immediately. If you","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"want to animate the change, use the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"-setDirection:animated:"},{"text":" method instead.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The heading of the map, measured in degrees clockwise from true north."}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"metadata":{"title":"direction","roleHeading":"Instance Property","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"direction","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"role":"symbol","remoteSource":{"fileName":"MLNMapView.h","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-native\/blob\/main\/platform\/ios\/src\/MLNMapView.h#L1102"},"fragments":[{"text":"direction","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"